  "tagline": "Managed Valkey and serverless cache/pub-sub from ex-DynamoDB engineers, plus self-hosted Valkey tooling.",
  "description": "Momento launched in 2022 as an API-first serverless cache and Topics pub/sub service, priced per GB transferred with no clusters to size. Its offering has since shifted toward Valkey: managed dedicated Valkey in Flex and Cluster tiers, plus a Valkey router, Kubernetes operator and hardened Valkey images for self-hosted fleets. Founded by former AWS DynamoDB engineers, it targets media, gaming and fintech companies with spiky traffic. Pick it if you want someone else to run Valkey at large scale, or a cache you can call over gRPC without managing connections.",
